# Phase-7 secrets layout: secrets/live/ (REAL materialized secrets) is gitignored;
# secrets/sample/ stays tracked. Real secrets live in the vault (RULE-SECRETS-VAULT-001).
**/secrets/live/
# Stray workspace-level secrets dump (real P8/keystores/tokens materialized at the
# PROJECT dir, outside the source repo's secrets/live) — never commit; secrets are
# managed in source + vault + deployment-layer only (RULE-SECRETS-VAULT-001).
kmp-project-template/secrets/


